id-MEggzZnP8tNzpSvf+uAgZw==&source=srp","experience":"8-10 Yrs","skills":[1,15,17,18,19,20,25,34,100,102,103]},{"title":"DevOps Engineer - VMware,Azure","company":"Blue Yonder","location":"Hyderabad","date_posted":"2026-08-14","url":"https://www.timesjobs.com/job-detail/devops-engineer-vmwareazure-blue-yonder-hyderabadsecunderabad-6-9-years-jobid-KTdQ__SLASH__f32D3lzpSvf+uAgZw==&source=srp","experience":"6-9 Yrs","skills":[15,103],"description":"**Key Responsibilities**\n* Design, deploy, and manage VMware virtualized environments (ESXi, vCenter) ensuring high availability and performance.\n* Architect and manage Azure infrastructure, including virtual machines, networking, storage, and identity services.\n* Administer and support Windows Server environments, including installation, configuration, and troubleshooting of Azure DevTest Labs \\& Horizon VDIs.\n* Manage Entra ID \\& Active Directory services including GPOs, OU structure, identity lifecycle, and security hardening.\n* Configure and maintain core infrastructure services such as DNS and DHCP.\n* Perform OS patching and vulnerability remediation across servers using enterprise patch management tools.\n* Utilize ManageEngine tools for monitoring, reporting, and IT operations management.\n* Develop and maintain automation scripts using PowerShell and Ansible to streamline operational tasks.\n* Abiding by Incident, Change and Problem Management procedures.\n* Monitor system performance, troubleshoot issues, and ensure SLA adherence.\n* Collaborate with cross\\-functional teams for infrastructure upgrades, migrations, and cloud adoption initiatives.\n* Ensure compliance with security standards, policies, and best practices.\n* Manage enterprise backup and recovery operations using Commvault, ensuring data protection, retention compliance, and successful disaster recovery readiness.\n\n\n**Required Skills \\& Experience**\n* 6\\+ years of experience in IT infrastructure with strong hands\\-on expertise in VMware and Azure.\n* Solid experience with Windows Server administration (2008/2012/2016/2019/2022/2025\\).\n* Strong knowledge of Entra ID, Active Directory, DNS, DHCP, and Group Policy management.\n* Hands\\-on experience with OS patching and patch management processes.\n* Proficiency in PowerShell scripting for automation and administration.\n* Experience with Ansible for configuration management and orchestration.\n* Familiarity with ManageEngine suite\n* Experience with Commvault backup solutions and disaster recovery processes.\n* Good understanding of networking concepts (TCP/IP, VLANs, firewalls).\n* Strong troubleshooting and problem\\-solving skills.\n\n\n**Preferred Qualifications**\n* Certifications in VMware (VCP), Microsoft Azure (AZ\\-104/AZ\\-305\\), or Windows Server.\n* Experience with hybrid cloud environments.\n* Knowledge of ITIL processes and service management frameworks.\n\n\n**Soft Skills**\n* Strong communication and stakeholder management skills.\n* Ability to work independently and in a team\\-oriented environment.\n* Proactive mindset with a focus on continuous improvement and automation.\n\n\n**Our Values**\n If you want to know the heart of a company, take a look at their values. Ours unite us. They are what drive our success \u2013 and the success of our customers. Does your heart beat like ours? Find out here: Core Values\n   \n\n  \n\n All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability or protected veteran status."},{"title":"Sr Manager, Software Development & Engineering Lead (PL) SRE (Hy","company":"Charles Schwab","location":"Hyderabad","date_posted":"2026-08-17","url":"https://www.timesjobs.com/job-detail/sr-manager-software-development-engineering-lead-pl-sre-hy-charles-schwab-hyderabadsecunderabad-10-12-years-jobid-58gAS6HlmG9zpSvf+uAgZw==&source=srp","experience":"10-12 Yrs"},{"title":"Senior Devops Manager